<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I sighed for rest and happiness,</l><l>I yearned for them, not Thee;</l><l>But, while I passed my Savior by,</l><l>His love laid hold on me.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I tried the broken cisterns, Lord,</l><l>But, ah, the waters failed!</l><l>E’en as I stooped to drink they fled,</l><l>And mocked me as I wailed.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The pleasures lost I sadly mourned,</l><l>But never wept for Thee,</l><l>Till grace the sightless eyes received,</l><l>Thy loveliness to see.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
